{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUSPECTO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>SUSPECTO</strong>, nothing is what it looks like! Rally your friends and plunge into this absurd social-deduction romp where you\u2019ll be howling with laughter while figuring out who\u2019s friend and who\u2019s foe. On one side, Killers melt into the crowd to quietly pick off their marks; on the other, sharp-eyed Agents hunt these impostors down. Strategy, stealth\u2014and yes, plenty of gas\u2014await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/bd0057d797a97aece3df03d9c4667d1d.poster.avif?t=1762093814\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/bd0057d797a97aece3df03d9c4667d1d.webm?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/bd0057d797a97aece3df03d9c4667d1d.mp4?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY AS A KILLER: BLEND \u2022 HUNT \u2022 VANISH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your three-step master plan:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe &amp; Identify</strong><br>You start unarmed, acting like a perfectly innocent bystander. Slip through the crowd, get within arm\u2019s reach of your assigned NPC targets, and study each one for two seconds to confirm it\u2019s the right mark. Stare too long, though, and Agents will sniff you out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arm Up &amp; Eliminate</strong><br>Once every target is confirmed, your weapons spawn in secret spots. Go for the <strong>Syringe</strong> if you prefer a silent, delayed kill, or the <strong>Knife</strong> for a risky but instant strike. Take out those yellow-highlighted targets without getting caught!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab the Key &amp; Escape</strong><br>After the last victim falls, a key appears on the map. Snatch it and sprint to your personal escape door. If even one Killer gets out, the Killers claim victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/6cc84b3dd2bd8fa4aa309b78d51cda41.poster.avif?t=1762093814\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/6cc84b3dd2bd8fa4aa309b78d51cda41.webm?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/6cc84b3dd2bd8fa4aa309b78d51cda41.mp4?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY AS AN AGENT: WATCH \u2022 ANALYZE \u2022 STRIKE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your greatest weapon is\u2026 your brain! (Okay, plus the sweet gun you unlock a bit later.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start unarmed, scanning the scene for anything off: Who\u2019s staring at a wall too long? Whose walk seems\u2026 weird? Was that a cloud of gas? When Killers lock in their targets, you\u2019re alerted and your weapon activates. Now it\u2019s hunting season!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But trigger discipline matters\u2014your <strong>innocent-shot allowance</strong> is limited. Blow all your chances on the wrong people and you\u2019re out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/2166457f654e0f7bc8b760c1b32ef8ec.poster.avif?t=1762093814\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/2166457f654e0f7bc8b760c1b32ef8ec.webm?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/2166457f654e0f7bc8b760c1b32ef8ec.mp4?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR GUT: BIGGEST FOE OR SECRET WEAPON?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killers have, let\u2019s say, sensitive stomachs. Gas builds up and can blow your cover at the worst time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manual Toot</strong> \u2013 Tap the fart key to vent quietly and reset the timer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncontrolled Blast</strong> \u2013 Wait too long and <i>BRAAAP!</i> A loud, colorful cloud reveals your spot to every Agent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet crisis breeds opportunity: anyone who steps into that cloud gets stunned and blurred, giving you precious seconds to slip away. A well-timed fart might just win the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/2f8dfb42ad4286709f4c7d7199ab1083.poster.avif?t=1762093814\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/2f8dfb42ad4286709f4c7d7199ab1083.webm?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/2f8dfb42ad4286709f4c7d7199ab1083.mp4?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Chaos from 1v1 up to 5v5</strong> \u2013 Face friends or match with strangers for tense, hilarious rounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Customizable Lobbies</strong> \u2013 Set the Killer target count, Agent mistake limit, and crowd density to tune difficulty your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Roles, Two Playstyles</strong> \u2013 Be the sneaky predator or the eagle-eyed detective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Humor &amp; Troll Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Drop gas at the perfect moment or switch outfits every 90 seconds to mess with everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Showdown</strong> \u2013 Killers know who the Agents are, but for Agents everyone\u2019s a suspect. Suspense stays sky-high.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So who are <strong>you</strong>? A cunning Killer hidden in plain sight, or an Agent who sees every clue?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick your side and join the chaos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/063a7b3b5622e3cd0d0b46ba4c910350.poster.avif?t=1762093814\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/063a7b3b5622e3cd0d0b46ba4c910350.webm?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/063a7b3b5622e3cd0d0b46ba4c910350.mp4?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3898070?t=1762093814","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/220368af9b2c26818d1c56549c217eea38db98e2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762093814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/fd4c8e0e3a55297857911364464f6480182ec025/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762093814","ca