 anything off: Who\u2019s staring at a wall too long? Whose walk seems\u2026 weird? Was that a cloud of gas? When Killers lock in their targets, you\u2019re alerted and your weapon activates. Now it\u2019s hunting season!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But trigger discipline matters\u2014your <strong>innocent-shot allowance</strong> is limited. Blow all your chances on the wrong people and you\u2019re out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/2166457f654e0f7bc8b760c1b32ef8ec.poster.avif?t=1762093814\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/2166457f654e0f7bc8b760c1b32ef8ec.webm?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/2166457f654e0f7bc8b760c1b32ef8ec.mp4?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR GUT: BIGGEST FOE OR SECRET WEAPON?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killers have, let\u2019s say, sensitive stomachs. Gas builds up and can blow your cover at the worst time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manual Toot</strong> \u2013 Tap the fart key to vent quietly and reset the timer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncontrolled Blast</strong> \u2013 Wait too long and <i>BRAAAP!</i> A loud, colorful cloud reveals your spot to every Agent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet crisis breeds opportunity: anyone who steps into that cloud gets stunned and blurred, giving you precious seconds to slip away. A well-timed fart might just win the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/2f8dfb42ad4286709f4c7d7199ab1083.poster.avif?t=1762093814\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/2f8dfb42ad4286709f4c7d7199ab1083.webm?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/2f8dfb42ad4286709f4c7d7199ab1083.mp4?t=1762093814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Chaos from 1v1 up to 5v5</strong> \u2013 Face friends or match with strangers for tense, hilarious rounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Customizable Lobbies</strong> \u2013 Set the Killer target count, Agent mistake limit, and crowd density to tune difficulty your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Roles, Two Playstyles</strong> \u2013 Be the sneaky predator or the eagle-eyed detective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Humor &amp; Troll Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Drop gas at the perfect moment or switch outfits every 90 seconds to mess with everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Showdown</strong> \u2013 Killers know who the Agents are, but for Agents everyone\u2019s a suspect. Suspense stays sky-high.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So who are <strong>you</strong>? A cunning Killer hidden in plain sight, or an Agent who sees every clue?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick your side and join the chaos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/extras/063a7b3b5622e3cd0d0b46ba4c910350.poster.avif?t=1762093814\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898070/ex